# The epilogue week at every leader (docs/EPILOGUE.md, "Carriers"; docs/DIALOGUE.md, "The last week").
# Lines read four separate things and never mix them up: the world's outcome (cure_held, ending), who
# was there (was), this player's route (route), and this character's memory. "The cure." gives the
# leader's own read and opens the built carriers (the season at this seat, where to look); "Me." is
# the leader on themselves, a week from the barrier. Nothing here pays anything.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ The Haven
conv epilogue.haven.cure
for leader:haven
when epilogue
topic "Ask about the cure."
prio world
voice haven

node start
  say? cure_held:haven :: "It went hand to hand, like we said. The houses argued about who went first. They're still arguing. That's how you know it's ours."
  say? cure_held:bastion :: "Bastion has it in a crate with a number on it. We're on their list. Everyone's on a list now."
  say? cure_held:redhand :: "The Red Hand has it, and a price on it. We're paying in tins. They're keeping the tins, mostly."
  say? cure_held:halcyon :: "The lab has published. Every name on the paper. I read it twice. I understood the second time."
  say? cure_held:everyone :: "Somebody walked it out to every house. No crate, no list. Nobody would say who to thank."
  say "It came. That's the part I keep saying out loud, to see if it's true."
  > @here "What happened here, this season?" -> season
  > @look "Where should I look?" -> look
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node season
  say "Sit down. I'll tell it the way the house tells it."
  do call:season
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node look
  say "Places you haven't been. I'll say them; you go."
  do call:look
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv epilogue.haven.me
for leader:haven
when epilogue
topic "Ask what they'll do now."
prio flavour
voice haven

node start
  say? route:won :: "You stood with us. I won't forget it, and nobody here will let me."
  say? route:lost :: "You picked someone else's way. You'll still be fed here. We've fed people who picked worse."
  say? was:every_name :: "You were at the table when the names were read. I saw you."
  say "When they open the north road I'll be the last one out. Somebody has to lock the stores."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Bastion
conv epilogue.bastion.cure
for leader:bastion
when epilogue
topic "Ask about the cure."
prio world
voice bastion

node start
  say? cure_held:bastion :: "Issued against name and signature, at the north road and the posts. In order. As planned."
  say? cure_held:haven :: "The Haven hands it out at its houses. No register. Somebody has to keep one, so we do."
  say? cure_held:redhand :: "Sold. At a price. Logged as theft. The log doesn't help, but it's accurate."
  say? cure_held:halcyon :: "Published. Every name on the paper but ours. Noted."
  say? cure_held:everyone :: "Carried out by persons unknown. To everyone. Unregistered. I've stopped writing to Command about it."
  say "Cure confirmed. Processing at the checkpoints. The order hasn't changed. The tone has."
  > @here "What happened here, this season?" -> season
  > @look "Where should I look?" -> look
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node season
  say "For the log, then."
  do call:season
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node look
  say "Grid squares you haven't covered. Cover them."
  do call:look
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv epilogue.bastion.me
for leader:bastion
when epilogue
topic "Ask what they'll do now."
prio flavour
voice bastion

node start
  say? route:won :: "You signed the roster and held to it. That goes in the log, in ink."
  say? route:lost :: "You signed for someone else. Logged. Then eat something."
  say? was:orders :: "You were there when the orders were read. You'll remember them longer than Command did."
  say "Hand over the post. Sign for the stores. Walk out last. Same as any posting."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ The Red Hand
conv epilogue.redhand.cure
for leader:redhand
when epilogue
topic "Ask about the cure."
prio world
voice redhand

node start
  say? cure_held:redhand :: "Ours. Priced fair. Fair to us. The queue's at the board, and the board's got prices on it."
  say? cure_held:bastion :: "Bastion's got it in a crate. We've got the crate's address. Patience."
  say? cure_held:haven :: "The Haven's giving it away. Free! Bad for business. Good for everyone else, I'm told."
  say? cure_held:halcyon :: "The beaks printed it. Can't sell a recipe everyone's read. I've tried."
  say? cure_held:everyone :: "Somebody gave it to everyone for nothing. I've been robbed before, but never on behalf of the whole Zone."
  say "It's out. Everything's for sale again, including leaving."
  > @here "What happened here, this season?" -> season
  > @look "Where should I look?" -> look
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node season
  say "The book remembers. Sit. I'll read you the good bits."
  do call:season
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node look
  say "Places you haven't robbed yet. That's a joke. Half of one."
  do call:look
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv epilogue.redhand.me
for leader:redhand
when epilogue
topic "Ask what they'll do now."
prio flavour
voice redhand

node start
  say? route:won :: "You stood with the book. The book stands with you. That's as warm as it gets here."
  say? route:lost :: "You backed the other horse. No hard feelings. A few soft ones."
  say? was:book :: "You were at the table when the book was closed. You know what's in it. That makes two of us."
  say "Me? Close the book. Count it twice. Then see what the outside charges for a sandwich."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ Halcyon
conv epilogue.halcyon.cure
for leader:halcyon
when epilogue
topic "Ask about the cure."
prio world
voice halcyon

node start
  say? cure_held:halcyon :: "Published. Every author named. The method is on the lab door. Someone corrected the spelling."
  say? cure_held:bastion :: "Bastion holds the stock. They issue it alphabetically. We are under H."
  say? cure_held:haven :: "The Haven distributes by hand. Unmeasured. Effective, by every measure we have."
  say? cure_held:redhand :: "Sold. The dose is ours. The price is theirs. We have recorded both."
  say? cure_held:everyone :: "Distributed without control or record. The outcome is good. We are revising our assumptions."
  say "The work is done. The record is not. It never is."
  > @here "What happened here, this season?" -> season
  > @look "Where should I look?" -> look
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node season
  say "The record, then. The short version."
  do call:season
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node look
  say "Unsampled locations. Your notebook should list them. It probably doesn't."
  do call:look
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv epilogue.halcyon.me
for leader:halcyon
when epilogue
topic "Ask what they'll do now."
prio flavour
voice halcyon

node start
  say? route:won :: "You chose the paper. Your name is in the acknowledgements. Small type. Still there."
  say? route:lost :: "You chose another route. That is also data."
  say? was:proof :: "You were there when the paper went out. Witness noted."
  say "Write it up. Every page, including the first one. Then leave by the north road like anyone."
  > @back "Something else." -> hub
